<group prefix="WebGpuSharp.FFI.">
	<comment location="CommandEncoderHandle">
		<summary> Encodes a series of GPU operations. A command encoder can record RenderPasses,
			ComputePasses, and transfer operations between driver-managed resources like Buffers and
			Textures. When finished recording, call CommandEncoder.Finish() to obtain a
			CommandBuffer which may be submitted for execution. </summary>

	</comment>
	<group prefix="CommandEncoderHandle.">
		<comment location="BeginComputePass">
			<summary> Begins encoding a compute pass described by descriptor. </summary>
			<param name="descriptor">The descriptor for the compute pass.</param>
			<returns>A ComputePassEncoder which encodes the compute pass.</returns>
		</comment>
		<comment location="SetLabel">
			<summary>
				 Set debug label of this command encoder. 
			</summary>
			<param name="label">
				 The new label.
			</param>
		</comment>
	</group>
</group>